specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/data-model.md:20834:Phase 78 scaffolded the full infrastructure for `Segment3DFromProjections` (domain class, operation, tool, 3D rendering, projection display, descriptors, serialization) but left `realize3D()` as a TODO stub returning placeholder coordinates `(0,0,0)→(1,0,0)`. Phase 107 implements the actual 3D reconstruction algorithm and adds geometric compatibility validation at creation time.
